Aggregate Node: Roll Up Data to a Higher Level
Use an Aggregate node to roll up data to a higher granularity in CRM Analytics. You can aggregate using: unique, sum, average, count, maximum, and minimum. You can group by any dimension or date column. You can also pivot dimensions as columns. For example, you can group opportunities by account to get account-level details, like total opportunity amount, average number of cases, and the average days to close an opportunity for each account. You can then pivot on account type to analyze each combination of account and account type.


