Needed
To manage and create a recipe:	Edit CRM Analytics Dataflows OR Edit Dataset Recipes
In a Data Prep recipe that already has at least one Input node, select the Add Node button (Add Node button) between two nodes or at the end of the recipe. To show the Add Node button between two nodes, hover the cursor on the connecting line.
